      // select_double_vpn_core's live heartbeat check server-side).
      // directConfig already passed _hasUsableVpnConfig above, so it is a
      // fully working single-hop config -- fail over to it instead of
      // stranding the user. The user's Double VPN preference itself is left
      // untouched so it resumes automatically once the core relay is
      // healthy again; it is not silently turned off.
